  "contract": [
    "Client.Reload validates and activates the accepted store generation without a store write. It orders mutations and applies publication guards.",
    "Shared-lease origin followers poll the authority head every 30 seconds independently of public source polling. An unchanged head avoids a full catalog read.",
    "A running follower must reconstruct matching retained inputs before publication ownership. Missing inputs cause a conflict before lease acquisition."
